# The Alliance Rogue level 16 lockpicking chain: one breadcrumb per home town
# to Renzik "The Shiv" at SI:7 in Stormwind (SI:7 2300 from Keryn Sylvius in
# Goldshire; To Hulfdan! and Kingly Shakedown 2299, 2298 from Hogral Bakkan
# in Kharanos; Erion Shadewhisper and Erion's Behest 2259, 2260 from Jannok
# Breezesong in Dolanaar), then Redridge Rendezvous (2281) and Alther's Mill
# (2282, the Certificate of Thievery) with Lucius in Lakeshire.
# Sources: Forever's Rogue class quest list
# (data/local/quest-audit/) for which quests Forever
# has, the rewards and Forever's changes (none for this chain);
# quests.json, npcs.json, objects.json and items.json for the givers, drops
# and places.
# Horns of Nez'ra (2358, Arantir beside Lucius) is not in the game on
# Forever: Arantir offers nothing after Alther's Mill (#948), it is not on
# Forever's Rogue class quest list, and forever-db/corrections removes it
# from the data.
# Forever's server data (gameobject_template): Lucius's Lockbox uses the
# same lock as the Horde's Jewel of the Southsea (about 25 Lockpicking by
# players' notes); the Practice Lockboxes the lowest lock.
# data/local/mechanics (quest-steps and quest-notes, checked 2026-10-20):
# Lucius on a crate on a Lakeshire dock, his Thieves' Tools on accepting,
# the practice lockboxes in the mill (some trapped), level 20 spiders near
# them on Forever, orcs roaming near the mill, Lockpicking's cap rising 5 per
# level; Pick Lock from Lord Tony Romano at SI:7, Thieves' Tools from Gerald
# Crawley in Lakeshire.
# The three breadcrumbs exclude one another: take the one of your town. Their
# race masks take any Alliance race; Skyborne, in Stormwind by about 15,
# take Keryn Sylvius's in Goldshire.
# Forever quest=2282 reports spiders near the practice boxes; use the
# current lock's requirement, not old comments' conflicting skill thresholds.
# The leveling guides leave these out: they teach no spell.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Renzik

step SI:7 (Goldshire)
  only Human,Skyborne
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip At 16 Keryn Sylvius, the rogue trainer upstairs in the Lion's Pride Inn in Goldshire, sends you to Renzik "The Shiv" in Stormwind. Taking it shuts out the other towns' breadcrumbs.
  level 16
  accept 2300                                 -- Keryn Sylvius

step To Hulfdan! (Kharanos)
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip At 16 Hogral Bakkan in the Thunderbrew Distillery in Kharanos sends you to Hulfdan Blackbeard in Ironforge's Forlorn Cavern.
  level 16
  accept 2299                                 -- Hogral Bakkan

step Hulfdan Blackbeard
  only Dwarf,Gnome
  zone Ironforge
  tip Hulfdan is in the house with a shady dealer outside, in the Forlorn Cavern, down the stairs. Then fly or take the Deeprun Tram to Stormwind.
  turnin 2299                                 -- Hulfdan Blackbeard
  accept 2298

step Erion Shadewhisper (Dolanaar)
  only NightElf
  zone Teldrassil
  tip At 16 Jannok Breezesong in the Dolanaar inn sends you to Erion Shadewhisper in Darnassus.
  level 16
  accept 2259                                 -- Jannok Breezesong

step Erion Shadewhisper
  only NightElf
  zone Darnassus
  tip Erion stands in the Cenarion Enclave. Then the boat from Rut'theran Village to Auberdine, and the boat from Auberdine to Stormwind Harbor.
  turnin 2259                                 -- Erion Shadewhisper, Darnassus
  accept 2260

step Renzik "The Shiv"
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Renzik stands upstairs in the SI:7 building in Old Town, behind the rogue trainers. Before you leave: if you lack Pick Lock, Lord Tony Romano in the SI:7 building teaches it; Lockpicking is the test of the next quest.
  turnin 2300 only Human,Skyborne             -- Renzik "The Shiv"
  turnin 2298 only Dwarf,Gnome
  turnin 2260 only NightElf
  accept 2281

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Lakeshire

step Lucius
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Head east through Elwynn Forest into Redridge, or fly to Lakeshire. Lucius stands on a crate on one of the Lakeshire docks, south of town; he gives you Thieves' Tools with the job (Gerald Crawley in Lakeshire sells more). Pick Lock does not work without the tools in your bags.
  turnin 2281                                 -- Lucius
  accept 2282

step Alther's Mill
  tip Alther's Mill stands east of Lakeshire, up off the road; Blackrock orcs roam near it. Inside, the Practice Lockboxes come back almost at once: pick them until Lucius's Lockbox opens for you (about 25 Lockpicking). Your Lockpicking cap rises 5 per level, so a low character may stall. Some boxes are trapped (a frost trap, for one); the skill still goes up. On Forever level 20 spiders wander near the boxes: clear them first or bring a friend. The lockbox always holds the token and is back two seconds after use. Practise on while it still gives skill: the next class quest needs about 75.
  collect 7871 quest 2282.1                   -- Token of Thievery: Lucius's Lockbox

step Back to Lucius
  turnin 2282 reward 7907                     -- Lucius: Certificate of Thievery
